    "question": {
      ":question/id": "c0b3be9d-cc1f-546a-a3fa-9f403fb61153",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices has a rank of $4?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, notice that a matrix of rank $4$ must have at least $4$ columns and at least $4$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the following matrices:\n\n- $A$ since it has only $3$ columns (and only $3$ rows).\n\n- $C$ since it has only $3$ columns.\n\n- $D$ since it has only $3$ rows.\n\nAlso, the matrix must have $4$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $E$ has exactly $4$ pivot columns, while the matrix $B$ has only $2$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(E)=4$ and $\\text{rank}(B)=2.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the matrix $E.$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "cd8f42f8-f1c7-53a4-969d-dd1670e4f61a",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "0c38a899-8460-5ec8-adca-f597f5752674",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "D=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -2 & 0 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "e1d528ff-749c-52c6-ac93-6eea9a4a27aa",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "A=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a7e9b063-71b4-5a81-8bc5-5e9649681e8e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c0c45a22-bdbe-5282-bac1-26dbf39818a1",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "E=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -2 & 4 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6 & 6\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "48559254-6e9e-52b4-b1e9-44f6e70688db",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 4 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
